#sortorder:2
#showas:虫群
A very difficult scenario. You against 3 AIs (Swarmer, Tsunami, and Turtle) set to difficulty 5 with a difficulty 8 Scourge backing them all up.

This is on the "Octopus" map type, with 60 planets.

Your starting fleet is set to "Classic," which has the most basic available options.

The main component of this one is the "Scourge", a new AI creation of collected and absorbed races, mutilated into hideous forms for each one, which functions very differently from the main AI.

It and the AIs will all be working together against you.